{
  "dom_id": "step-q84609",
  "name": "Question 20",
  "problem": "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe matrix $A$ has eigenvalues ${\\lambda }_{1}=-3,$ ${\\lambda }_{2}=4,$ and ${\\lambda }_{3}=1.$\nFind a diagonal matrix $D$ and an invertible matrix $P$ such that $D={P}^{-1}AP.$",
  "worked_solution": "We apply the diagonalization algorithm.\n\n**Step 1.**  Notice that we are already given the eigenvalues of the matrix: \n\n$\\,$ ${\\lambda }_{1}=-3,\\,$ ${\\lambda }_{2}=4,\\,$ ${\\lambda }_{3}=1.$ \n\n**Step 2.** Now, we need to find an eigenvector basis of $A.$ Applying our usual method, we get the following. \n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{1}=-3,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(-3)I & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-(-3)I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector  ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{2}=4,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-4I & =[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-4I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector  ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{3}=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-I & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector ${v}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}-11 \\\\ -28 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}].$\n\n**Step 3.** We construct the diagonal matrix $D$ and the invertible matrix $P$ in the usual way, and this gives us the following:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,P=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -11 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -28 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 12\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [
    {
      "key": "selection",
      "type": "radio",
      "choices": [
        {
          "option": "a",
          "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-84609-a",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "$D=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$P=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -11 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 12\\end{aligned}]$",
